{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11108080","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11108080","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1110808001:0":{"text":"おお！お前たち、若いのになかなかやるじゃないか！","source_cn":"哦哦！你们几个娃子，战斗本领真不错！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACC9523CDBC52C5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110808002:0":{"text":"これなら、サンドクローなんて目じゃないな！","source_cn":"那群流沙之爪对你们完全造不成威胁！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35936983825E7ED0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1110808002":{"text":"これなら、サンドクローなんて目じゃないな！","source_cn":"那群流沙之爪对你们完全造不成威胁！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35936983825E7ED0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110808003:1":{"text":"ここを通って鹹水町へ向かった商隊がいなかったか？","source_cn":"之前有没有商队经过这里，往咸水镇去？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA77D6C145C3C49DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110808004:1":{"text":"ああ、ついこの前見かけたぞ！あいつら、この俺よりも頑固でなぁ！","source_cn":"就在不久前！他们对金属小硬币的执着，比俺这牛脾气还倔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A018F66FC462B78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_titl